Modifications
-------------

This is not an unmodified copy. Upstream KServe does not compile against
k8s.io v0.35, where the PodSpec struct conversion adds `WorkloadRef`, so this
copy is patched to build against that version. See the `replace` directive and
accompanying comment in `control-plane/workloads-and-policies/go.mod`.

